### Summary

The dialog that shows one file of the customer and changes its title, description or the file.

### Display

- "Preview media" with the file as an image, read for staff with the `read` permission, its Title and Description in the admin's language or else in German, and "Change file"; a file that can't be read closes the dialog — [reads](aim:juicebar.entities#Record:CustomerFile), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.media#Requirements[FILEVIEW]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTROLE])

### Actions

