- binds: `service:entities#getMedia` — as: handler
- provenance: inferred

## Operation: AddCustomerFile

### Summary

A staff member adds a file to a customer.

### Input

```schema
customerId: string required ref(juicebar.entities#Customer.id)
file: file required
fileName: string required
mediaType: string
type: string
title: string
description: string
language: string required
```

### Authz

- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerEditor`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerAdmin`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerSuperAdmin`

### Ensures

- The file is kept in the customer's own folder of the media store under its cleaned name, and added to the customer's files with its media type, kind, extension and size, its title and description under the given language — [mutates](aim:juicebar.entities#Record:Customer), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.media#Requirements[FILEADD])
- The backend refuses it without the `update` permission, and for a customer of another organisation — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTROLE]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTORG])

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/entities/details/media-entity/add-media/add-media-dialog.component.ts#AddMediaDialogComponent.submit` — as: component
- binds: `service:entities#uploadMedia` — as: handler
- provenance: inferred

## Operation: UpdateCustomerFile

### Summary

A staff member changes a file's title, description or the file itself.

### Input

```schema
customerId: string required ref(juicebar.entities#Customer.id)
fileId: string required
title: string
description: string
language: string required
file: file
fileName: string
```

### Authz

- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerEditor`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerAdmin`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerSuperAdmin`

### Ensures

- The title and the description are stored under the given language, the other languages' texts untouched; a file given replaces the stored one — [mutates](aim:juicebar.entities#Record:Customer), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.media#Requirements[FILEVIEW]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar#Requirements[LANG])
- The backend refuses it without the `update` permission, and for a customer of another organisation — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTROLE]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTORG])

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/entities/details/media-entity/preview-media/preview-media-dialog.component.ts#PreviewMediaDialogComponent.submit` — as: component
- binds: `service:entities#updateMedia` — as: handler
- provenance: inferred

## Operation: DeleteCustomerFile

### Summary

A staff member deletes a file of a customer.

### Input

```schema
customerId: string required ref(juicebar.entities#Customer.id)
fileId: string required
```

### Authz

- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerEditor`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerAdmin`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerSuperAdmin`

### Expects

- The staff member confirmed the deletion.

### Ensures

- The file is removed from the customer's files and the list is read again — [mutates](aim:juicebar.entities#Record:Customer), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.media#Requirements[FILEDELETE])
- The backend refuses it without the `delete` permission, and for a customer of another organisation — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTROLE]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTORG])

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/entities/details/media-entity/media-entity.component.ts#MediaEntityComponent.remove` — as: component
- binds: `service:entities#deleteMedia` — as: handler
- provenance: inferred

## Operation: UploadFormFile

### Summary

A staff member uploads a file for the form entry a customer came in with.

### Input

```schema
customerId: string required ref(juicebar.entities#Customer.id)
file: file required
```

### Authz

- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerEditor`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerAdmin`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerSuperAdmin`

### Ensures

- The file is sent to the forms module for the customer's form entry, and the page reads the customer's files again — [invokes](aim:juicebar.entities#Capability:FormUploads), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.media#Requirements[DOCUPLOAD])

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/entities/details/documents-entity/documents-entity.component.ts#DocumentsEntityComponent.upload` — as: component
- provenance: inferred

## Operation: AddCustomerImage

### Summary

A staff member adds an image to a customer.

### Input

```schema
customerId: string required ref(juicebar.entities#Customer.id)
image: file required
```

### Authz

- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerEditor`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerAdmin`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerSuperAdmin`

### Expects

- The file is an image.

### Ensures

- The image is stored 320, 640 and 1280 pixels wide and added to the customer's images, and the page reads them again — [mutates](aim:juicebar.entities#Record:Customer), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.media#Requirements[IMGLIST])
- The backend refuses it without the `update` permission, and for a customer of another organisation; the refusal is shown — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.media#Requirements[IMGLIST]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTROLE]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTORG])

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/entities/details/addlogo-entities/addlogo-entities.component.ts#AddlogoEntitiesComponent.upload` — as: component
- binds: `service:entities#uploadLogo` — as: handler
- provenance: inferred
